  i A boolean prefix tells readers that the value is either true or false.
  
  i Rename it so that its name starts with one of these prefixes: are, can, does, has, have, is, requires, should, was, were, will, needs.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

